Benchmark specification
-----------------------

This application implements aspects of:

Reidmen Aróstica et al., “A software benchmark for cardiac elastodynamics,”
Computer Methods in Applied Mechanics and Engineering 435 (2025), 117485.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cma.2024.117485

The article is available under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0. The article
is not included in this repository.

Reference dataset
-----------------

R. A. Arostica Barrera and Cristobal Bertoglio, “A software benchmark for
cardiac elastodynamics,” Zenodo record (2024).
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14260459

The dataset is licensed CC BY 4.0. Its approximately 23.2 GB archive and raw
team pickle files are not vendored. Checked-in report JSON and SVG figures do
contain transformed comparison material: interpolated team statistics,
minimum/maximum envelopes, selected Simula curves, and derived metrics. These
were computed by CoupFE-Cardiac from hash-pinned publisher files and are
identified as modifications of the cited dataset, not raw publisher data.

